      "ITK-SNAP",
      {
       "items": [
        {
         "lead": null,
         "text": "Open-source 3D medical image segmentation"
        },
        {
         "lead": null,
         "text": "Linked 2D views and a 3D view of each image"
        },
        {
         "lead": null,
         "text": "Manual and semi-automatic segmentation tools"
        }
       ],
       "paras": [],
       "props": {},
       "quote": "",
       "table": [],
       "url": null
      }
     ],
     [
      "Deep-learning server",
      {
       "items": [
        {
         "lead": null,
         "text": "A separate model server, often on a GPU"
        },
        {
         "lead": null,
         "text": "Runs an interactive AI model, nnInteractive"
        },
        {
         "lead": null,
         "text": "A person guides it with clicks and scribbles"
        }
       ],
       "paras": [],
       "props": {},
       "quote": "We added an automatic model to the server, and a way for an AI agent to drive ITK-SNAP.",
       "table": [],
       "url": null
      }
     ]
    ],
    "slide": 2,
    "title": "ITK-SNAP and its deep-learning server"
   },
   {
    "props": {
     "layout": "problem-solution"
    },
    "sections": [
     [
      "Today",
      {
       "items": [
        {
         "lead": "Models are not perfect.",
         "text": "A person still has to check and correct the result."
        },
        {
         "lead": "The pipeline stops.",
         "text": "Someone opens the image, fixes it, and passes the file back by hand."
        },
        {
         "lead": "The fix is not recorded.",
         "text": "It is saved as a new mask. Change history is lost."
        }
       ],
       "paras": [],
       "props": {},
       "quote": "",
       "table": [],
       "url": null
      }
     ],
     [
      "What we built",
      {
       "items": [],
       "paras": [],
       "props": {
        "arrows": "Request auto segmentation, Auto segmentation result, Route for human correction, audit record"
       },
       "quote": "Every edit, by the agent or by the person, comes back as a structured record.",
       "table": [
        [
         "Box",
         "Role"
        ],
        [
         "Model server",
         "proposes a segmentation"
        ],
        [
         "AI agent",
         "calls both as tools (MCP)"
        ],
        [
         "ITK-SNAP",
         "a person corrects it here"
        ]
       ],
       "url": null
      }
     ]
